=3 Notes
* Only one of the four Undead monsters will spawn.

=2 Walkthrough
* Defeat all monsters to complete this assault
* Randomly, one monster will repop as __Undead__ shortly after being defeated. The undead version must be defeated as well.
* The map shows the approximate location of all monsters. Use it.

